## Models

### `Package`
Represents an extension package available from a plugin server.

```csharp
public class Package : Entity
{
    public string? ServerId { get; set; }
    public string Name { get; set; } = default!;
    public string? Description { get; set; }
    public string? IconUrl { get; set; }
    public string? WebPageLink { get; set; }
    public string[] SupportedOperatingSystems { get; set; } = [];
    public string[] SupportedArchitectures { get; set; } = [];
    public List<PackageVersion> Versions { get; set; } = [];
}
```

### `PackageVersion`
Represents a specific version of a package.

```csharp
public class PackageVersion
{
    public Version Version { get; set; } = Version.Parse("1.0.0");
    public DateTime ReleaseDate { get; set; }
    public string? ReleaseNotes { get; set; }
    public long? SizeBytes { get; set; }
    public string? DownloadUrl { get; set; }
    public string? Checksum { get; set; }
}
```

### `PackageDownloadResult`
Result of a package download with disposable stream.

```csharp
public class PackageDownloadResult : IDisposable
{
    public string PackageId { get; init; } = default!;
    public Version Version { get; init; } = default!;
    public long ContentLength { get; init; }
    public MemoryStream Stream { get; init; } = default!;
    public void Dispose() => Stream.Dispose();
}
```

**Issue**: Uses `MemoryStream` — entire package loaded into memory. For large extensions this causes OOM.

### `QueuedDownload`
Represents a download in the queue.

```csharp
public class QueuedDownload
{
    public string PackageId { get; set; } = default!;
    public Version Version { get; set; } = Version.Parse("0.0.1");
    public PluginServer Server { get; set; } = default!;
    public bool IsUpdate { get; set; }
}
```

### `PluginServer`
Configuration for a plugin distribution server.

```csharp
public class PluginServer : Entity
{
    public string Name { get; set; } = default!;
    public string BaseUrl { get; set; } = default!;
    public string ApplicationId { get; set; } = default!;
    public int Priority { get; set; }
    public bool IsEnabled { get; set; } = true;
    public bool IsDefault { get; set; }
}
```

**Issue**: Uses `[Newtonsoft.Json.JsonIgnore]` on `IsDefault` but `PluginPackageService` uses `System.Text.Json`. Inconsistent serialization.

### `PackageManagerStatus`
Event args for status changes.

```csharp
public class PackageManagerStatus : EventArgs
{
    public bool IsIndexing { get; set; }
    public bool IsDownloading { get; set; }
    public string? CurrentDownload { get; set; }
    public double DownloadProgress { get; set; }
}
```

