## Options

### `PluginServerOptions`
Configuration for plugin server behavior and OS/arch detection.

```csharp
public class PluginServerOptions
{
    public string DetectedOs { get; }
    public string DetectedArch { get; }
    public List<DefaultServer> DefaultServers { get; set; } = [];
    public int TimeoutSeconds { get; set; } = 30;
    public bool EnableRetry { get; set; } = true;
    public int MaxRetries { get; set; } = 3;
}
```

**Known issues:**
- `TimeoutSeconds`, `EnableRetry`, `MaxRetries` are defined but **never used** by `PluginPackageService`
- `FreeBSD` maps to `"linux"` (incorrect)
- `DefaultServers` hardcodes production URLs in compiled code

