## Extension Methods

### `CyrenaBuilderExtensions.AddExtensaComponents`
Registers all Extensa Components services and UI.

```csharp
public static CyrenaBuilder AddExtensaComponents(this CyrenaBuilder builder)
```

**Registers:**
- `IPluginServerService` → `PluginServerService`
- `IPluginPackageService` → `PluginPackageService`
- `IPackageManager` → `PackageManager`
- `DownloadService` as singleton
- `PluginServer` store (`extension_servers`)
- `Package` store (`extension_packages`)
- Settings component `Servers` under "Extensions" section
- Default plugin servers (hardcoded production URLs)
- Background download service startup action

